{
  "uid": "jobbi-prueba-01",
  "title": "1 · Humo (preparación)",
  "description": "Guía: docs/guia-de-pruebas.md · Ninguno: comprobación previa.",
  "tags": [
    "jobbi",
    "pruebas"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "5s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-15m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "editable": true,
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Qué es esta prueba",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Comando:** `./scripts/k6-en-cluster.sh humo`  \n**Caso del documento:** Ninguno: comprobación previa.\n\n**Qué deberías ver:** un pulso pequeño de tráfico en **Rate**, **Errores** en 0 % y la serie COMISION_COBRADA en **Eventos consumidos**.\n\n**Criterio de éxito:** ✓ en todos los checks de k6 y consistencia 100 %.\n\nAntes de empezar: `./scripts/reiniciar-entorno.sh`. No interrumpas el script en las esperas."
      },
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Rate · solicitudes por segundo (gateway)",
      "description": "Throughput por endpoint del caso de uso. Nominal ≈ 12 TPS.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (route) (rate(jobbi_http_request_duration_seconds_count{service=\"gateway\", route=~\".*check-out|.*check-in|.*acuerdos.*|.*billeteras.*|.*cobro\"}[20s]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{route}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(jobbi_http_request_duration_seconds_count{service=\"gateway\"}[20s]))",
          "legendFormat": "TOTAL gateway",
          "refId": "B",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "id": 2,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Errors · % de respuestas 5xx por servicio",
      "description": "SLO < 1 % (línea roja).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "100 * (sum by (service) (rate(jobbi_http_request_duration_seconds_count{status=~\"5..\"}[20s])) or 0 * sum by (service) (rate(jobbi_http_request_duration_seconds_count[20s]))) / (sum by (service) (rate(jobbi_http_request_duration_seconds_count[20s])) > 0)",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "custom": {
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line+area"
            },
            "fillOpacity": 5
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "id": 3,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Eventos consumidos por resultado (por minuto)",
      "description": "COMISION_COBRADA, DUPLICADO (Idempotent Receiver), NOTIFICADO, ERROR.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (consumidor, resultado) (rate(jobbi_eventos_consumidos_total[20s])) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "{{consumidor}} · {{resultado}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "id": 4,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16
      }
    }
  ],
